<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RGC waits with Discovery stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RGC waits with Discovery stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>RGC Ltd said on Wednesday that it would make a decision on its 8.1 percent stake in Discovery Petroleum NL once Discovery has made a formal recommendation on the takeover bid from Premier Oil.</p>
<p>British-based Premier is currenly offering 70 cents per Discovery share, valuing the oil producer at A$91.2 million.</p>
<p>&quot;You would have to wait for a recommendation from directors of Discovery. I am a director of Discovery and I can say nothing (about) what may be the case with our own stake,&quot; RGC managing director Mark Bethwaite told reporters.</p>
</text>
